{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vaulting Over It</strong> is a difficult climbing game where your mistakes are permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics-Based Vaulting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750943177\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your branch is both your greatest ally and your worst enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Failing as a Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/Gif5.gif?t=1750943177\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trying is the first step toward failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/Gif3.gif?t=1750943177\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which only make things worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">One Map, No Checkpoints</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/Gif1.gif?t=1750943177\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Because who needs progress when you can start over... forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fully Physics-Driven Body</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/Gif44.gif?t=1750943177\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It moves exactly how you tell it to, unfortunately.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3083230?t=1750943177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750943177","ca